    "Type": 1,
    "Title": "Show HN: Eigendrum - Draw any shape and hear what it sounds like as a drum",
    "Url": "https://baselashraf81.github.io/eigendrum/",
    "Description": "Hi HN, I built Eigendrum, a web tool that solves the 2D wave equation for arbitrary shapes so you can hear what they sound like as drums.\u003Cp\u003EHow it works:\n* Solves -\u2207\u00B2u = \u03BBu using finite element analysis (K\u03C6 = \u03BBM\u03C6) on a triangle mesh.\n* Validated to \u0026lt;0.1% error against closed-form solutions for circles (Bessel zeros) and rectangles.\n* Sound model factors in strike location, Rayleigh damping, and mallet width.\n* Includes Kac drums I \u0026amp; II to demonstrate identical sound spectra from different",
    "Metadata": {
